# Line endings for the extracted work.
#
# The harness applies patches with `git apply`, and a patch generated against LF
# files will not apply to a CRLF checkout. On Windows core.autocrlf=true converts
# on checkout, so without this the transcript replay breaks on one machine and
# works on another - which is the worst kind of demo failure.
#
# Scoped deliberately. Assets/ and ProjectSettings/ are frozen and are left to
# whatever git was already doing with them; this file must not cause the Unity
# project to be rewritten.
core/**      text eol=lf
harness/**   text eol=lf
docs/**      text eol=lf
AGENTS.md    text eol=lf
README.md    text eol=lf
.gitattributes text eol=lf
